/edgar/data/731766/000073176626000062/unh-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" \"its,\" \"UnitedHealth Group,\" or the \"Company\" used in this report refer to UnitedHealth Group Incorporated and its subsidiaries.","zh":"本報告中使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」、「其」、「聯合健康集團」或「本公司」是指聯合健康集團公司及其子公司。"},{"en":"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated is a health care and well-being company with a mission to help people live healthier lives and help make the health system work better for everyone. Our two distinct, yet complementary businesses — Optum and UnitedHealthcare — are working to help build a modern, high-performing health system through improved access, affordability, outcomes and experiences for the individuals and organizations we are privileged to serve.","zh":"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated 是一家醫療保健和福祉公司，其使命是幫助人們過上更健康的生活，並幫助讓醫療系統更好地為每個人服務。我們兩個截然不同但又互補的企業——Optum 和 UnitedHealthcare——正在努力透過改善我們有幸服務的個人和組織的獲取、負擔能力、結果和體驗，幫助建立一個現代化、高性能的醫療系統。"},{"en":"The ability to analyze complex data and apply deep health care expertise and insights allows us to serve patients, consumers, care providers, businesses, communities and governments with more innovative products and complete, end-to-end offerings for many of the biggest challenges facing health care today.","zh":"分析複雜數據並應用深厚的醫療保健專業知識和見解的能力使我們能夠為患者、消費者、護理提供者、企業、社區和政府提供更具創新性的產品和完整的端到端產品，以應對當今醫療保健面臨的許多最大挑戰。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The terms \"we,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" \"its,\" \"UnitedHealth Group,\" or the \"Company\" used in this report refer to UnitedHealth Group Incorporated and its subsidiaries.","zh":"本報告中使用的術語「我們」、「我們的」、「其」、「聯合健康集團」或「本公司」是指聯合健康集團公司及其子公司。"},{"en":"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated is a health care and well-being company with a mission to help people live healthier lives and help make the health system work better for everyone. Our two distinct, yet complementary businesses — Optum and UnitedHealthcare — are working to help build a modern, high-performing health system through improved access, affordability, outcomes and experiences for the individuals and organizations we are privileged to serve.","zh":"UnitedHealth Group Incorporated 是一家醫療保健和福祉公司，其使命是幫助人們過上更健康的生活，並幫助讓醫療系統更好地為每個人服務。我們兩個截然不同但又互補的企業——Optum 和 UnitedHealthcare——正在努力透過改善我們有幸服務的個人和組織的獲取、負擔能力、結果和體驗，幫助建立一個現代化、高性能的醫療系統。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"As a diversified health care company, we operate in highly competitive markets across the full expanse of health care benefits and services. Our competitors include organizations ranging from startups to highly sophisticated Fortune 50 global enterprises, for-profit and non-profit companies, and private and government-sponsored entities. New entrants to our markets and business combinations among our competitors and suppliers also contribute to a dynamic and competitive environment. We compete fundamentally on the quality and value we provide to those we serve, which can include elements such as product and service innovation; use of technology; consumer and provider engagement and satisfaction; and sales, marketing and pricing. See Part I, Item 1A, \"Risk Factors\" for additional discussion of our risks related to competition.","zh":"作為一家多元化的醫療保健公司，我們在競爭激烈的市場中經營各種醫療保健福利和服務。我們的競爭對手包括各種組織，從新創公司到高度複雜的財富 50 強全球企業、營利性和非營利性公司以及私人和政府資助的實體。我們市場的新進業者以及競爭對手和供應商之間的業務合併也有助於創造一個充滿活力和競爭的環境。我們的競爭從根本上取決於我們為服務對象提供的品質和價值，其中包括產品和服務創新等要素；技術的使用；消費者和提供者的參與度和滿意度；以及銷售、行銷和定價。有關我們與競爭相關的風險的更多討論，請參閱第一部分第 1A 項「風險因素」。"},{"en":"We have obtained trademark registration for the UnitedHealth Group, Optum and UnitedHealthcare names and logos. We own registrations for certain of our other trademarks in the United States and abroad. We hold a portfolio of patents and have patent applications pending from time to time. We are not substantially dependent on any single patent or group of related patents.","zh":"我們已獲得 UnitedHealth Group、Optum 和 UnitedHealthcare 名稱和標誌的商標註冊。我們在美國和國外擁有某些其他商標的註冊。我們擁有一系列專利，不時有待審批的專利申請。我們基本上不依賴任何單一專利或一組相關專利。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Unitedhealthcare","val":344903000000,"zh":"聯合醫療"},{"name":"Total Optum","val":270620000000,"zh":"總光"},{"name":"Optumrx","val":154726000000,"zh":"奧圖姆克斯"},{"name":"Optumhealth","val":101957000000,"zh":"奧圖姆健康"},{"name":"Optuminsight","val":19417000000,"zh":"奧圖明"}],"total":447567000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":53380000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":38038000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":447567000000}},"peers":["LLY","V","AVGO","CRM","COST"]}}